WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A pendulum moves, though the holder cannot feel deliberately moving it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The motion is real. The first explanation may not be.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers separated movement, expectation and the feeling of control.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Meditation-audio claims deserve the same separation: what is supplied and what is supported?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 offers short sessions in several styles. Its promised mental benefits remain unverified here.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve minutes first. Look at the evidence, then make your choice.
